ERC6909Premium_deposit
├── when token.transferFrom reverts
│   └── it should revert with the bubbled transferFrom error and leave balance unchanged
├── when FoT token transferFrom delivers less than amount
│   └── it should revert with DepositBalanceMismatch and leave balance unchanged
├── when amount is zero
│   └── it should no-op
├── when all preconditions hold
│   └── it should IERC20.safeTransferFrom msg.sender to address(this), increment balanceOf[to][tokenId] by amount, and emit Transfer from address(0) to to
└── supportsInterface
    ├── it should return true for the ERC-165 interface id
    ├── it should return true for the ERC-6909 interface id
    └── it should return false for an unsupported interface id
